      "message": "If it causes bazel reanalysis I don\u0027t think it\u0027s worth doing this change.\n\nYou can just use symlinkForestVersion instead, maybe doing the LINT.ifChange thing.\n\nOr if you could somehow limit the hash to only hash symlink_forest.go and not all of soong that would also be good. But difficult to implement.",
